        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Moss and winding vines give this gnarled staff of wild wood a vibrant green tinge and the smell of an ancient forest. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 item bonus to Nature checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge].</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tangle Vine]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flourishing Flora], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Protector Tree]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Entangling Flora], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shape Wood]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>"
